.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK MILESTONE EVENTS"
.SH NAME
hamstik milestone events \- Read the milestone history feed (newest first)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik milestone events [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read the milestone history feed (newest first)
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I ID
Milestone id (UUID)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --before-event-id
The event id the (older) page starts before
.TP
.B --limit
Maximum events per page
